# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BharatSource — .gitignore
# Protects secrets and build artifacts. See SECURITY.md before your
# first commit. NOTE: backend/DB/ (demo data + bcrypt hashes) is
# intentionally NOT ignored so a fresh clone runs with data — keep the
# repo PRIVATE and wipe/rotate before real users (SECURITY.md).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Secrets — never commit these
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!*.env.example
backend/.env
frontend/.env.local
TESTING-SERVER.md

# Dependencies
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Next.js / build output
.next/
out/
build/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Runtime logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
/tmp/bs-backend.log

# User-uploaded images written to disk at runtime (regenerated; not source)
backend/public/uploads/
frontend/public/uploads/

# Client-facing cost/planning deliverables — not for the repo
docs/production-plan/

# Local snapshot of frontend/ taken before the in-place UI redesign.
# Reference-only, never committed — see WEB-REDESIGN.md.
frontend-backup/

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp
